  "releaseNotes": "- **Depends on Compze.Threading.Interprocess instead of Compze.InterprocessObject, which is retired:** `IInterprocessObject<T>`, which it keeps its `InterprocessEndpointRegistry`'s state in, moved to Compze.Threading.Interprocess. Nothing public changes.\n- **Requires newer minor versions of other Compze packages:** Compze.Abstractions 0.5.0-alpha (was 0.4.1-alpha), Compze.Internals.SystemCE 0.12.0-internal (was 0.10.0-internal), Compze.Tessaging 0.12.0-alpha (was 0.11.0-alpha), Compze.Threading 0.14.0-alpha (was 0.13.0-alpha). Upgrading to this version upgrades each package listed here too, so their changelogs apply to this upgrade as well.",
